# Microsoft Clone Website

A responsive front-end clone of the Microsoft homepage built using HTML5 and CSS3. This project recreates key sections of the Microsoft website, including a navigation bar, hero section, product cards, social media section, and footer.

## 📌 Features

- Responsive Navigation Bar
- Hero Banner Section
- Product Categories Icons
- Product Cards Display
- Social Media Links Section
- Multi-column Footer
- Modern UI Design using CSS Flexbox and Grid
- Font Awesome Icons Integration

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Font Awesome 6

# 📸 Website Sections

## Navigation Bar

- Microsoft logo
- Product menu links
- Search, Cart, and User icons

## Hero Section

- Promotional banner
- Product description
- Call-to-action button

## Icons Section

- Surface Devices
- Xbox
